		<h1 class="content-title">About</h1>
				<p>We are are a simple community which gives access to play pokemon online for free.<br />
Moreover, this site is always update with the latest game of pokemon.<br />
Do you  love pokemon? This is the real deal for you.</p>
<p>If you love pokemon like we do, you will love this game! It is NO ripoff, it is the ORIGINAL, encoded for computer use! Controls are just like on the console, and gameplay does not differ at all. If you would like to have the ultimate experience again, then don&#8217;t hesitate! </p>
<p>Go on a MEGA Adventure, and collect all the Gym-badges so you can finally become the one and only Pokemon Master! You have to challenge Gym leaders in order to win badges, and to progress in The scenario gameplay mode. </p>
<p>Complete the game or simply enjoy it by travelling around collecting all the pokemon you desire! If you are a real fan then you would not settle with simply being the Master, you have to catch all possible pokemon! Be the best and remember: You gotta catch &#8216;em all!</p>
<p>Enjoy play pokemon.<br />
You can contact us through this e-mail adresss:<br />
fadouss@yahoo.com</p>
